{"title":"Surveyor Roadmap","role":"Surveyor","summary":"A Surveyor measures and establishes the position, elevation, boundaries, and physical characteristics of land and built environments. Modern surveying combines traditional field measurements with GNSS, total stations, digital levels, drones, GIS, photogrammetry, LiDAR, and 3D modeling.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Geoinformatics / Geomatics Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Surveyor measures and establishes the position, elevation, boundaries, and physical characteristics of land and built environments. Modern surveying combines traditional field measurements with GNSS, total stations, digital levels, drones, GIS, photogrammetry, LiDAR, and 3D modeling."},{"type":"p","text":"For a Geoinformatics / Geomatics Engineering graduate, surveying is a direct and technically aligned career pathway."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Land surveying"},{"text":"Topographic surveying"},{"text":"Engineering surveys"},{"text":"Construction surveying"},{"text":"Boundary/cadastral surveying"},{"text":"GNSS surveying"},{"text":"Hydrographic surveying"},{"text":"UAV/drone surveying"},{"text":"LiDAR mapping"},{"text":"GIS data collection"},{"text":"Survey data processing"},{"text":"3D terrain modeling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modern Surveyor is increasingly a field + geospatial technology professional, rather than someone working only with conventional instruments."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Area","Potential Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Land Surveying"},{"text":"Land Surveyor"}],[{"text":"Engineering Surveying"},{"text":"Engineering Surveyor"}],[{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"Construction Surveyor"}],[{"text":"Topographic Mapping"},{"text":"Topographic Surveyor"}],[{"text":"Cadastral"},{"tex